Industrial Standard Assignment: Python Matplotlib (Scatter, Bar, Histogram, Pie Charts)
Course

Python Data Visualization with Matplotlib

Assignment Title

Data Visualization Using Matplotlib

Objective

The objective of this assignment is to develop practical skills in creating professional-quality data visualizations using Matplotlib. Students will learn how to represent relationships, comparisons, distributions, and proportions through different chart types.

Dataset

Create a CSV file named employee_sales.csv

Employee	Department	Sales	Experience	Age
Ali	Sales	52000	2	24
Ahmed	Sales	68000	5	29
Sara	Marketing	47000	3	26
Fatima	HR	39000	4	31
Bilal	IT	81000	7	35
Ayesha	IT	74000	6	32
Hassan	Finance	62000	5	30
Zain	Marketing	55000	4	28
Maryam	Finance	59000	5	29
Usman	HR	43000	3	27
Task 1 – Scatter Plot
Objective

Visualize the relationship between employee experience and sales performance.

Requirements

Create a scatter plot showing:

X-axis → Experience (Years)
Y-axis → Sales
Marker size = 100
Marker color = Blue
Add Grid
Add Chart Title
Label both axes
Expected Learning

Students should understand:

Correlation between variables
Positive/negative relationships
Scatter plot customization
Task 2 – Bar Chart
Objective

Compare total sales of employees.

Requirements

Create a vertical bar chart.

Employee names on X-axis
Sales on Y-axis
Different color for each bar
Display sales values above bars
Rotate X-axis labels if necessary
Add Title
Add Grid
Expected Learning

Students should understand

Category comparison
Bar customization
Annotation of values
Task 3 – Histogram
Objective

Analyze the distribution of employee sales.

Requirements

Create a histogram.

Dataset = Sales column
Number of bins = 5
Edge color = Black
Transparency = 70%
Add Title
Add X-axis Label
Add Y-axis Label
Add Grid
Expected Learning

Students should understand

Data distribution
Frequency analysis
Histogram bins
Task 4 – Pie Chart
Objective

Show department-wise employee distribution.

Requirements

Count employees in each department and create a pie chart.

Features:

Display percentage
Start angle = 90°
Shadow enabled
Explode the largest slice
Equal aspect ratio
Add Title
Expected Learning

Students should understand

Percentage representation
Part-to-whole relationship
Pie chart customization
Bonus Challenge

Create a dashboard using plt.subplots() containing:

Scatter Plot
Bar Chart
Histogram
Pie Chart

Arrange all four charts in one figure.

